Data extracted without substituting resource values from the official installed
Android SDK Platform 16 API36 revision2 resources.arsc. Only unqualified resource
variants are selected; provenance.json records the source and output hashes.
No android.jar executable class stubs, raster images, fonts or media are included.
framework-xml.bin.gz contains exact compiled XML resources referenced by this
profile, including vector definitions, selectors, layouts and animations.
framework-xml-index.json records the source hash and every original XML entry.
Original AOSP style/attribute/public-ID reference XML headers are preserved in
upstream-reference/. They are reference sources, not a claim that SDK revision2
was rebuilt bit-for-bit from that tag.
